      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's what you think? i mean, some of the parents at the meetings are saying that focusing on the \"negative\" stuff just makes kids feel guilty or resentful of their own country, and that it might actually hurt their sense of belonging or patriotism. wouldn't a curriculum that highlights our shared values be more important for keeping the community together?",
